# inc-c36o: as fear-flight-plain.keys, then make the goblin a blackguard (fear-immune, not M_PSYCHO).
@until "Wizard Mode Options" w y
@choose "Genocide Everything"
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT*3 ENTER
w
@choose "Add Template to Creature"
RIGHT*3 ENTER
@choose "blackguard"
.*16
@dump:end
